          "descriptionModule": {
            "briefSummary": "Adult participants with spinocerebellar ataxia type 2 (SCA2) who carry \u226533 cytosine, adenine, guanine (CAG) repeats in the ATXN2 gene, and who have met all protocol eligibility criteria will be randomized to receive a single dose of ARO-ATXN2 or placebo and be evaluated for safety, tolerability, pharmacokinetic (PK) and pharmacodynamic (PD) parameters."
